<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fabric Splicing Design Board</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Top Row Grid */
        .top-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* Middle Row Grid */
        .middle-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .middle-row .item:nth-child(1) {
            width: 25%;
        }

        .middle-row .item:nth-child(2) {
            width: 25%;
        }

        .middle-row .item:nth-child(3) {
            width: 45%;
        }

        /* Generic Item Styling */
        .item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        /* Placeholders */
        .placeholder {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .top-row .placeholder {
            height: 260px;
        }

        .middle-row .item:nth-child(1) .placeholder {
            height: 320px;
        }

        .middle-row .item:nth-child(2) .placeholder {
            height: 280px;
        }

        .middle-row .item:nth-child(3) .placeholder {
            height: 250px;
        }

        /* Text Block */
        .text-block {
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            letter-spacing: 0.2px;
            padding: 0 5px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .text-chinese {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .text-english {
            color: #333;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">

        <!-- Top Row Images -->
        <div class="top-row">
            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">拼接抽刀面料</div>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Black and white furry pattern]</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">毛皮镂空拼接面料</div>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Black and white graphic pattern]</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">拼接面料</div>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Stacked horizontal strips of fur]</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">拼接编织面料</div>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: White knitted sleeve with fur patches]</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">拼接工艺</div>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Grid of 6 smaller square textures]</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Middle Row Images -->
        <div class="middle-row">
            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">抽刀拼接面料</div>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Garment back with white puffy sleeves]</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">加入一些兔毛面料</div>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Puffy white fur shape]</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">拼接裘皮面料</div>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Close-up of blue textured fabric]</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Text Block -->
        <div class="text-block">
            <div class="text-chinese">
                本系列面料使用裘皮与针织加入少量彩色进行设计，将不同品种的裘皮进行拼接染色等工艺再造，或者将裘皮与其他面料进行拼接缠绕产生，特别的效果，再其次将裘皮进行不同颜色的拼接拼出不同肌理的感觉，黑牛仔面料则采用拼接穿插。抽丝做出肌理感在加入印花系列标志使整个系列更加突出主题，并且使用裘皮契合大赛要求。
            </div>
            <div class="text-english">
                This series of fabrics is designed by adding a small amount of black and white jeans to fur and knitting. Different kinds of fur are reconstructed by splicing and dyeing, or the fur is spliced and wound with other fabrics.Special effect, secondly, fur is spliced with different colors to give different feeling of texture, black denim fabric is interspersed with splicing, silk drawing to make texture feeling in addition to the printing series logo to make the wholeSeries more prominent theme, and the use of fur match the requirements of the competition.
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>
